%% Source for Fig. 5.4 (sec:design-loop). Render to vector PDF (adaptive-loop.pdf), e.g.:
%%   mmdc -i adaptive-loop.mmd -o adaptive-loop.pdf
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Sensing source (Tobii)
    participant C as Backend core
    participant R as Reading surface
    actor O as Researcher

    loop Adaptive cycle — while the session is live
        T->>C: gaze sample
        activate C
        C->>R: live gaze (real-time channel)
        R->>C: reading observation (gaze → content)
        C->>C: analysis — project oculomotor events
        C->>C: decision — evaluate (built-in / external)
        alt advisory mode
            C->>O: proposal
            O-->>C: approve / reject
        else autonomous mode
            Note over C: applied without operator
        end
        C->>C: validate, then commit at controlled boundary
        Note right of C: anchor restores the reader's position
        C-->>R: adapted text + intervention event (re-render)
        C->>C: checkpoint (best-effort)
        deactivate C
    end
